<Slide style={{ background: '#0B1020', padding: 60 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>工程化设计 · 可复现</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>09 / 别人也能跑起来</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.4)', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, marginTop: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 300 }}>
            <Box style={{ padding: 20, background: 'linear-gradient(160deg, #4F46E5 0%, #151B33 100%)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>三条命令就能跑</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    前端、桌面端、聚合服务各自独立，
                    单独跑任何一个都能看到完整功能。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ gap: 12, marginTop: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#94A3B8' }}>TS / TSX</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>15,173 行</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#94A3B8' }}>Rust（桌面壳）</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>484 行</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#94A3B8' }}>Python（聚合）</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>5,192 行</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#94A3B8' }}>自检脚本</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#22D3EE' }}>66 项全通过</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#94A3B8' }}>运行时依赖</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>17 个</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ padding: 16, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#22D3EE', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>cd personal-os && npm install && npm run dev</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 8 }}># 网页版，http://127.0.0.1:5173，零配置看到全部界面</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ padding: 16, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#22D3EE', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>npm run tauri:build && npm run dist:portable</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 8 }}># 桌面版：27MB 安装包 / 便携版 zip，双击即用，无需管理员权限</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ padding: 16, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#22D3EE', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>cd aggregator && python main.py</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 8 }}># 聚合服务：自动检查 Python 与依赖、装好后打开 http://127.0.0.1:8787</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ padding: 16, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#22D3EE', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>npm run model:setup</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 8 }}># 可选：下载 25MB 中文向量模型，之后永久离线可用</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, padding: 16, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #22D3EE' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>构建期就拦住的坑</span>
            ：命令名静态比对脚本（前端调用名 vs Rust 注册名）在打包前跑，避免"点了没反应"这类只有运行时才暴露的静默失败。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 670 }}>个人工作台 · v0.2.0</Text>
</Slide>
